       "locator": "Section 2.4 'Parabolic subgroups and quotients', printed pp. 38-41: Proposition 2.4.1(i)-(v), Definition 2.4.2 of the descent classes and of W^J, Lemma 2.4.3, Proposition 2.4.4(i)-(ii), Corollary 2.4.5(i); the mirrored system ^JW in (2.11)-(2.12), printed p. 41."
      },
