       "locator": "Section 1, p. 6 of the published paper: the displayed definitions of W^J, ^JW and ^IW^J=^IW cap W^J as sets of double coset representatives, immediately after Proposition 1.4."
      },
      {
       "title": "Sara Billey, Matjaz Konvalinka, T. Kyle Petersen, William Slofstra and Bridget Tenner, Parabolic double cosets in Coxeter groups (arXiv:1612.00736v2)",
       "url": "https://arxiv.org/pdf/1612.00736v2",
       "locator": "Section 2.1 'one-sided parabolic cosets' (printed pp. 6-7 of the arXiv version): characterization of W^J and ^IW by absent descents and the parabolic decomposition w=uv."
      }
     ]
